        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/7dc01e7662ea78608faa7a6da9abd01d.avif?t=1787298597\" width=616 height=170 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>※For the best experience, please enable voice playback in the options menu.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/af7e348f9c240598e9189978b6af4cf4.avif?t=1787298597\" width=240 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masamune Kashin and Amelie<strong> Blanshett</strong> are young mages serving in <br>the Magic Corps of the Greatland Kingdom.They were given a mission—to infiltrate Caledonia Magic Academy and conduct an undercover investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their objective is to determine whether the rumors of demon summoning within the academy are true.Kashin assumed it would be a simple task, just handling some students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, his superior revealed something shocking…Driven by ambition, Amelie was determined to see the mission through.<br>For her, it was a chance to elevate the reputation of mages everywhere.Beside her, Kashin remained optimistic—his thoughts already drifting elsewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Just the two of us on this mission... I’ll tell her how I feel t<strong>his</strong> time for sure.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kashin has long harbored feelings for Amelie, the girl who grew up with him and taught him magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, within Caledonia Magic Academy, countless thoughts and intentions are already beginning to intertwine.Amelie Blanshett’s charm hasn’t captured only Kashin’s heart—others, too, find themselves drawn to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seemed like a simple assignment turns into a relentless trial, and Kashin keeps falling short, again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that moment, a mysterious girl appeared—changing everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the influence of magic, the week falls into an endless cycle—repeating again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, the story begins—but where will it end...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/709eaeb46be2ff7d4177fa8ed818a012.avif?t=1787298597\" width=335 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/daea699295344cdfbe43d1d29414dd10.avif?t=1787298597\" width=616 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amelie Blanshett</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Height】163cm </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Place of Origin】Great Land Kingdom </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has shown talent in magic since childhood, and her abilities were recognized, leading to an invitation to join the Magic Corps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is like an elder sister figure to the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a kind and cheerful personality, and is diligent and hardworking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/4692412cd6deeb8581ff3d37c31584cc.avif?t=1787298597\" width=616 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jackson Steinfeld</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Representative of the Magic Research Club in his third year. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talented in magic, ambitious. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has a personality that doesn't hesitate to use any means for his goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leon Amador</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is handsome and kind, and gets along well with everyone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has a complex about not having much talent in magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He likes girls, and has several ex-girlfriends among his classmates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/ffe5cdddc77ffb5b99928a1234f7aad3.avif?t=1787298597\" width=616 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiori Kamono</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a modest and earnest personality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has good grades and is trusted by the teachers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She belongs to the Student Council.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elena Fontaine</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She likes handsome guys and is the center of attention in her class. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a tough personality, but she is devoted to the person she loves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She belongs to the Magic Research Club. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/147bcd9a273b6a0def5991dde567855f.avif?t=1787298597\" width=616 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professor Hoffman</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a professor of magic and the advisor to the student council.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is very strict with the school rules and is not popular among students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is also strict with female students as a teacher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/4b2f9de1062aacad3b23edf000d02fc2.avif?t=1787298597\" width=272 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Caledonia Magic University</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A prestigious magic school located in the northern part of the Great Land Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has the longest history among magic schools and has produced numerous famous wizards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various clubs related to magic, such as the Magic Research Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The northern region is the front line of the battle against demons, and monsters occasionally emerge, resulting in poor public safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/e0243a265b95d9b1b9fde6fd504796b0.avif?t=1787298597\" width=304 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943420/extras/d6fa94809484c2218f3384e8a2a11c58.avif?t=1787298597\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic JRPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich storyline content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
